{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"b9a5fe62a114aa78f4bc027da8c1d5bb7cd0a85fb72945238d11f0da221b904d","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"f471c037a2afba6c79d5a02631a012e998e9b0cab8caab6485033b9a4a723312","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f4754d3cfb3fe41979a96ea2fa4fad855be7ec6539af94a434ed0dd221cc4ebe","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"psi-archery.lua@624a673 L238-239：原文'attack a target each turn for %d turns'，译文'在 %d 回合内自动攻击1个目标'漏掉'每回合'，读起来像整个持续期内只攻击一次；原文'to determine attack and damage'，译文'决定攻击'漏掉'伤害'，而意志/灵巧同样用于计算伤害（L239）。"},{"revision_key":"f4765ec95527516db4bb3413af3a7dc1e8bd44837acad5302b4ddf0395e4ca2a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f4d315f2149baa7490569bbc71b3f14c4931c490889ae1e8fb85eeed4c5c9b5d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f52f924e44e80972b4b00c21041e829c652e28e43a3a8316a44b940556e62da5","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f5318eee7537d7b96e491c2d3280e7defb3014038711f3e77567182edd9475a0","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f5651a163a271ec1f85b8fa30f051438e433501110c1e640ad4d13df34e0e4b7","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"traps.lua@624a673 L2188-2193：陷阱触发时分别施加 EFF_STUNNED（4 回合，受 canBe('stun') 判定）和 EFF_POISONED（4 回合，power=dam/10，受 canBe('poison') 判定）。原文'stuns and poisons'，译文只写'震慑且每回合造成自然伤害'，漏掉'中毒'，把毒素效果写成了无条件的持续伤害；按译文句式，'持续4回合'也只修饰伤害，没有覆盖震慑。"},{"revision_key":"f56e57b65f02b9e8ca224b62b093ab11cefa9d7101b3e9459ecc25a7437cf8b8","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"源码锚点为 pending，以下仅按冻结原文与译文对照：①首句'No text would be complete without at least a brief note of...'（任何著作都少不了对这些种族的简述）被译成'没有任何文字可以诠释那些……野蛮种族'，意思相反；②'They have a more advanced form of speech than their mountain-dwelling cousins'被译成'有着更为敏捷的速度'，speech 误作 speed，还与后半句'以移动迅速闻名'重复；③'Records of them exist only from the last few hundred years'被译成'近一百年'，数量错误；④'towards the end of the Age of Pyre'被译成'在烈火纪时'，漏掉'末期'。"}]}